From 0e706a79ad31a03708285e1c9d7a26672512eb81 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A2Tools-patch <patch@localhost>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:54:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Plugins: internet radio, from the listed stations only
 (permission radio)

A plugin with the permission "radio" may play sound from the radio
stations' stream servers in RADIO_HOSTS (its page's media-src), and only
those; any other plugin's page plays none (media-src 'none'). Listening
only: the page still connects nowhere (connect-src 'none'), and the
meter's own network client doesn't know these hosts. For the Radio plugin.
